<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine ups CITIC warrant issue size.</title>
<headline>Peregrine ups CITIC warrant issue size.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said in a statement on Thursday it had revised the size of its call warrant issue on CITIC Pacific Ltd shares to 160 million warrants.</p>
<p>A company official had said earlier on the same day that the firm intended to issue 110 million American style call warrants on CITIC Pacific shares.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$37.60	 PREMIUM	 13.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.52	  GEARING	 7.23X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  30.OCT.97	MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE	  HK$37.60</p>
<p>NOTES: APPLICABLE LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>	  SETTLEMENT: SHARES IN CITIC PACIFIC WITH CASH</p>
<p>ALTERNATIVE AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
